proton-autogen (2.9.3) noble; urgency=medium

  * New features
    - Added new Adwaita UI theme and Kitty UI theme
    - Added launch progress reporting for improved UX.
    - Added improved UX error handling and runtime feedback.
    - Added structured JSON logging:
      ~/.local/share/proton-autogen/logs/proton-autogen.json
    - Added multilingual About menu support:
      FR, EN, ZH, ES, DE, UK, PT.
    - Added multilingual Requirements menu support:
      FR, EN, ZH, ES, DE, UK, PT.
    - Added toast notification system:
      FR, EN, ZH, ES.
    - Added GPU profile management with automatic AMD/NVIDIA detection.
    - Added stable Sensors menu.
    - Added advanced system diagnostics for:
      Debian, Ubuntu, Linux Mint, Arch Linux, and CachyOS.
    - Added Lutris game export support.
    - Added optimized executable search with caching.
    - Fixed MangoHud working directory handling for 32-bit applications.

  * UX
    - Added profile badges (DX11, DX12, Win95, Install, etc.).
    - Added platform and game badges (Steam, Battle.net, Favorites, Playtime, etc.).
    - Added live language badges (FR/EN/ZH/ES/DE).
    - Improved game list layout and GTK4 interface.

  * Statistics
    - Improved playtime tracking and dashboard statistics.

  * Runtime
    - Improved Proton launch stability.
    - Improved session tracking.
    - Improved runtime error handling.

  * Backend
    - Improved configuration and prefix management.
    - Improved Proton detection and selection.

  * Game management
    - Improved game scanning performance.
    - Added game registry.
    - Improved Windows executable detection.

  * Bug fixes
    - Fixed launch return code handling.
    - Fixed badge refresh issues.
    - Fixed game list update inconsistencies.

  * Developer
    - Improved backend/UI separation.
    - Improved debugging tools and internal APIs.


